bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    engine2d_retained_damage_rejects_unfocused_window_opacity_2026-11-26, 0, "engine2d_draw_ir_render_composition_damaged_with_images (compositor_engine2d.spl:1099, engine2d_wm_frame_executor.spl:440) rejects any composition with a batch whose embedding opacity_milli != 1000 as retained-composition-unsafe-embedding. Every unfocused WM window batch carries opacity 930, so any hosted scene with more than one window (or no focused window) never takes the retained damage replay and repaints in full. Theme independent: the plain stream has the same 930 batch."

