    engine2d_retained_damage_rejects_unfocused_window_opacity_2026-11-26, P2, fix-implemented-verification-pending, "retained damage replay rejects every scene with an unfocused (opacity 930) window", doc/08_tracking/bug/engine2d_retained_damage_rejects_unfocused_window_opacity_2026-11-26.md, 1, src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/engine2d/draw_ir_adv.spl, 2026-11-26, 2026-11-26, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    engine2d_retained_damage_rejects_unfocused_window_opacity_2026-11-26, 0, "2026-11-26 wm-lane-20261126 Linux aarch64 seed cargo-target-wr-seed1126b: one-window 160x120 scene with focused=false; batches wm-desktop/wm-chrome/wm-taskbar-objects op=1000, surf op=930 clip=true, plain and fluid_light alike; damaged replay returns retained-composition-unsafe-embedding on NVIDIA GB10 and llvmpipe."
    engine2d_retained_damage_rejects_unfocused_window_opacity_2026-11-26, 1, "2026-11-26 wm-lane-20261126 seed fb80903917d6d5f5: retained replay now layers sub-opaque surfaces once per replay (one surface-sized layer per batch over the union of its damage clips, composited at opacity_milli under each clip). engine2d_retained_group_opacity_damage_spec 2/2 on NVIDIA GB10 and llvmpipe (fluid_light, aetheric_dark; replay == device first frame outside damage + fresh device frame inside; fresh full device readback with canary). Perf 3 rounds: full 11.3-16.2 s, replay1 11.1-11.2 s, replay3 11.6 s: exact but no win; still rejected: prepared-plan site, single-root path, parent-sampling batches."
    engine2d_retained_damage_rejects_unfocused_window_opacity_2026-11-26, 2, "2026-11-27 Fable review fixes: one shared layering predicate (_engine2d_draw_ir_uses_embedded_surface) for full frame and replay; replay is batch-major over disjoint damage rects and acquires each layer like the full frame (single-slot pool off Vulkan, for the non-reclaiming SimpleOS bump heap); spec canary poison proven visible through engine before the read; themed spec keeps CPU parity in the clock box except the tracked corner-AA pixels (<=20, which equal the fresh device frame). On 89f2b4e1854, seed fb80903917d6d5f5: group-opacity 2/2 and themed 8/8 on NVIDIA GB10 and llvmpipe. Perf: any replay touching a window costs about a full frame on Vulkan (layer create/render/readback)."
